  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div><div><div><p><a href=\"\"><img src=\"https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/ff64e6d141801dbac20dba751384bbd49f916a4a.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><div><p>Industrial Robots that Learn and Operate Like Humans</p></div></div><div><p><h3>Jobs at <!-- -->Mbodi AI</h3></p><div><div><p>New York, NY, US</p><p>$150K - $250K</p><p>0.25% - 2.00%</p><p>3+ years</p></div><div><p>New York, NY, US</p><p>$150K - $250K</p><p>0.25% - 2.00%</p><p>3+ years</p></div><div><p>New York, NY, US</p><p>$100K - $250K</p><p>0.50% - 2.00%</p><p>3+ years</p></div></div></div><div><p><h3>Why you should join <!-- -->Mbodi AI</h3></p><p>Mbodi is an embodied AI platform that makes robots learn like humans, with natural language. So anyone can teach robots new skills by talking to them and execute the learned skills reliably in production, in minutes. We are pioneering the next wave of robotics, where advanced generative models meet real-world applications. Backed by top investors and already working with global industrial partners (e.g., ABB), we’re redefining what’s possible in robotics and automation.</p></div></div><div><div><p><a href=\"https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/mbodi-ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://bookface-images.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/logos/bb1239ee67e01455546fe8a413724b572346e680.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAQC4NIECAHML2X4TM%2F20260730%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;X-Amz-Date=20260730T143520Z&amp;X-Amz-Expires=3600&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEM7%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJIMEYCIQD5FKXFv7lUUy1FeBoGueXpntUNk9rlI32cZGBxdqJ5aQIhANX3U%2Bb39%2BwIxUuRSaN7RLYBNcNVVjDK9apcFAv80t7lKu4DCJf%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEQABoMMDA2MjAxODExMDcyIgzyQsPpHaJR%2FaKgjEMqwgNYx64TlbNElCmWA3QcKqw3nzunqJRTUnS3PRYcAoR1KBzI8wpDhwWYfKXvckglT96KoIMpAaXQklRYiNl15gPzo%2FQgA6ztGgHHcoQLB0ENcT0OurHu8pmwq%2FyiWJjM9h3bkOcZhEO0jM8